    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in any Fight phase, right after an enemy unit picks its targets. Choose one CELESTIAN SACRESANTS unit it targeted with at least one attack. For the rest of the phase, attacks against that unit get -1 to the Hit roll. If the chosen unit is Righteous, you may also pick another CELESTIAN SACRESANTS unit in your army that is within 6\" of it and not Battle-shocked; attacks against that second unit also get -1 to the Hit roll for the rest of the phase.",
